WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
Rounding means choosing the nearest multiple of ten. Let us

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.720
round forty seven to the nearest ten.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:13.150
Forty seven lies between forty and fifty. The halfway point

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.230
is forty five.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:22.420
Forty seven is above forty five, so it is closer

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:27.260
to fifty. Move up to fifty.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:31.970
Forty seven rounded to the nearest ten is fifty. For

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:36.330
whole numbers, a units digit of five or more rounds

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:40.690
up; less than five rounds down.
